<h2>Batch Stage Updated 🚚</h2>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>Your crop batch has advanced to the next stage in the supply chain!</p>

<div class="card">
    <p><span class="highlight">Batch ID:</span> {{batchId}}</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">New Stage:</span> {{stage}}</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Updated By:</span> {{actor}}</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Time:</span> {{timestamp}}</p>
</div>

<p>You can track the ongoing journey of your crop by logging into your dashboard.</p>

<a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button">View Dashboard</a>

<p>Thank you for contributing to a transparent supply chain!</p>
<p>— The CropChain Team</p>
